{"id":"8f382173effd5662","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-pa-provable-formula.md","title":"PA Provable Formula","display":"df-pa-provable-formula — PA Provable Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","aliases":["89-df-pa-provable-formula"],"display":"df-pa-provable-formula — PA Provable Formula","depends_on":["[[89-df-pa-provable]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-pa-provable-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-pa-provable-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pa-provable-formula — PA Provable Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"95d5a7c3d486f284\" href=\"?note=95d5a7c3d486f284\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable\">89-df-pa-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-pa-provable-formula-—-PA-Provable-Formula-$\\mathrm{Prov}_{PA}$\">df-pa-provable-formula — PA Provable Formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{PA}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is the set of PA sentences.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAProv}\">\\(\\mathrm{PAProv}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95d5a7c3d486f284\" href=\"?note=95d5a7c3d486f284\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable\">89-df-pa-provable</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是下述定义的 PA 可证句子集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa\\text{-}provable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{PAProv}(\\varphi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa\\text{-}provable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{PAProv}(\\varphi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> : the set of PA-provable sentences</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAProv}\">\\(\\mathrm{PAProv}\\)</span> : the PA-provability predicate on sentences</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-pa-provable-formula-—-PA-Provable-Formula-$\\mathrm{Prov}_{PA}$","text":"df-pa-provable-formula — PA Provable Formula $\\mathrm{Prov}_{PA}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-pa-provable","status":"resolved","id":"95d5a7c3d486f284","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"8